Test data
---------
The test suite downloads Access databases from these projects, pinned by commit
and checksum in src/test/resources/fixtures/corpus.tsv:

- Jackcess (https://github.com/spannm/jackcess, src/test/resources/data),
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
- Jackcess Encrypt (https://github.com/jahlborn/jackcessencrypt, src/test/data),
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
- mdb-reader (https://github.com/andipaetzold/mdb-reader, test/), licensed under
  the MIT License

They are fetched at build time into target/fixtures/ and are not distributed with
AccessConverter.
